to 2 levels deep in /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1, excluding hidden items:\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "<|tool_call|>{\"name\": \"run_command\", \"arguments\": {\"command\": \"ls /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai\"}}<|tool_call_end|>"}, {"role": "user", "content": "EXECUTION RESULT of [str_replace_editor]:\nHere's the files and directories up to 2 levels deep in /workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai, excluding hidden items:\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/README.md\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/__init__.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/_extensions\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/_extensions/__init__.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/_extensions/gmm\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/_extensions/loader.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/_version.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/__init__.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/auto3dseg\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/datasets.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/deepedit\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/deepgrow\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/detection\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/mmars\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/nuclick\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/pathology\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/reconstruction\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/tcia\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/apps/utils.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/auto3dseg\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/auto3dseg/__init__.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/auto3dseg/algo_gen.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/monai/auto3dseg/analyzer.py\n/workspace/Project-MONAI__MONAI__1.1/mon